{"3679260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Sentinel", "steam_appid": 3679260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Sentinel</strong> is a fast-paced first-person action RPG inspired by classic role-playing games. Explore dangerous dungeons, battle relentless enemies, and carve your own path through deep combat and magic systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring traditional RPG elements such as <strong>talent trees</strong>, <strong>shops</strong>, <strong>loot progression</strong>, and <strong>character builds</strong>, Dark Sentinel blends old-school depth with modern, responsive action. Fight using melee weapons and magic, grow stronger through your choices, and descend into dark, unforgiving environments where every encounter matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>dungeon crawling</strong>, meaningful progression, and skill-based combat, Dark Sentinel is built for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many Unique gameplay elements await you in Dark Sentinel.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with magic or melee, or combine them in your own playstyle, with many different talents to change your way of playing. Throw axes, use magic, or just attack enemies with your melee skills. Attack from all sides with a fun an engaging melee combat system.  <br> <br>Use your magic to interact with the environment! For Example; You can turn on torches with fire magic, and turn them off with frost magic. This mechanic also allows for many different puzzles and interactable mechanics within Dark Sentinel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.poster.avif?t=1769876663\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.webm?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.mp4?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against epic bosses with fun and unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.poster.avif?t=1769876663\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.webm?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.mp4?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider Wislisting our game as that would be the best way to support it. Follow us on instagram @sentinelstudiosltd or join our discord for more info.  <br> <br>Discord:  <br> <br>Thanks for reading and hopefully, you'll enjoy the game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Sentinel</strong> is a fast-paced first-person action RPG inspired by classic role-playing games. Explore dangerous dungeons, battle relentless enemies, and carve your own path through deep combat and magic systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring traditional RPG elements such as <strong>talent trees</strong>, <strong>shops</strong>, <strong>loot progression</strong>, and <strong>character builds</strong>, Dark Sentinel blends old-school depth with modern, responsive action. Fight using melee weapons and magic, grow stronger through your choices, and descend into dark, unforgiving environments where every encounter matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>dungeon crawling</strong>, meaningful progression, and skill-based combat, Dark Sentinel is built for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many Unique gameplay elements await you in Dark Sentinel.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with magic or melee, or combine them in your own playstyle, with many different talents to change your way of playing. Throw axes, use magic, or just attack enemies with your melee skills. Attack from all sides with a fun an engaging melee combat system.  <br> <br>Use your magic to interact with the environment! For Example; You can turn on torches with fire magic, and turn them off with frost magic. This mechanic also allows for many different puzzles and interactable mechanics within Dark Sentinel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.poster.avif?t=1769876663\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.webm?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/2e8a124c5239bc38f4165b3de86d5388.mp4?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against epic bosses with fun and unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.poster.avif?t=1769876663\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.webm?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/extras/09543add700ccf99aa6651dfff14c7f0.mp4?t=1769876663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider Wislisting our game as that would be the best way to support it. Follow us on instagram @sentinelstudiosltd or join our discord for more info.  <br> <br>Discord:  <br> <br>Thanks for reading and hopefully, you'll enjoy the game!</p>", "short_description": "Dark Sentinel throws you straight into a brutal, first-person action RPG where ancient dungeons, twisted magic, and unforgiving enemies stand between you and the legendary Arcanium Crystal. Delve into atmospheric, old-school-inspired levels packed with traps, puzzles, and platforming challenges,", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/b7299309a10e0458c33f9a18bf2fdc08f427ae05/header.jpg?t=1769876663", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/f4caed19434380b736c61488ade65fb094bec00f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769876663", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679260/f4caed19434380b736c61488ade65fb094bec00f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769876663", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX